{"material_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2019a.q23.material.recovered", "text": "材料： 四（2）班小明最近在校表现不好，学习成绩直线下滑。为了解小明在家中的情况，班主任顾老师到小明家家访。在同小明父亲交流情况时，顾老师引用了一句古语：“养不教，父之过。”小明的父亲听后很不高兴地说：“顾老师，您这话欠妥。孩子是我生养的，我不送他到学校接受教育，剥夺他受教育的权利，那是我的过错。现在，我把孩子送到学校接受教育，你们教不好，这应是老师的过错，怎么能说是我们做家长的过错呢?”结果，双方来能在教育小明的问题上达成共识。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "987684de98241f71bb9dba6b07945991ed5b9ff28c6319bcc253ce5d293285c4", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1453, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1670, "next_source_question_number": 24, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 23, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "987684de98241f71bb9dba6b07945991ed5b9ff28c6319bcc253ce5d293285c4"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2019a.q23"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.m2.k1", "ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.m3.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.ability.care", "ntce.xiaoxue.ability.manage"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.202.r017", "ntce.outline.202.r020", "ntce.outline.202.r022"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2019a.q23"], "word_count": 217, "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "jiaoxue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "987684de98241f71bb9dba6b07945991ed5b9ff28c6319bcc253ce5d293285c4", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1453, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1670, "next_source_question_number": 24, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（